'' 'sizeof( cva_list )' NAMING THE TYPE (T84). The name parses as an expression there, and
'' only a declaration's type reference predefined it, so it was TKO0743: 'cva_list' is not
'' declared, where fbc-modern 1.20 prints 8 on win64 -- as it does for the size of a
'' variable of the type, which already worked. See src/symbols/exprtypename.bas.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -target windows-x86_64 tests/mir/src/cva-sizeof-name.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0743
'' EXPECT-OUT: store @named, %
'' EXPECT-OUT: const i64 8
'' EXPECT-OUT: store @vialen, %
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
